---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Portfolio / Case Studies
description: "A selection of recent 3D prints and prototypes by Bondar Labs — FDM, resin, file support, and batch production examples."
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Bondar Labs · Portfolio</p>
    <h1>Portfolio / Case Studies</h1>
    <p class="lead">Short, technical summaries — what it was, how it was made, and what mattered.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {% for cs in collections.caseStudies %}
        <a class="card card-link" href="{{ cs.url }}">
          <div class="card-media"><img src="{{ cs.data.coverImage }}" alt="{{ cs.data.title }}" loading="lazy"></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="kicker">{{ cs.data.tech }} · {{ cs.data.material }}</div>
            <h2 class="h3">{{ cs.data.title }}</h2>
            <p class="muted">{{ cs.data.summary }}</p>
            {% if cs.data.typicalValue %}
              <p class="tiny muted" style="margin:10px 0 0">Typical project value: <strong>{{ cs.data.typicalValue }}</strong></p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
